WEBVTT

00:00:01.970 --> 00:00:09.580
<i>They say there was a huge disaster
called Blast Fall 12 years ago.</i>

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:15.540
<i>Mom said lots of people died
and lots of people went missing.</i>

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:22.980
<i>But it all happened
before I was born.</i>

00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:28.790
<i>You ask me? I don't really know
that much about it...</i>

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:39.140
<i>You know the continuation of the fairy tale
I've wanted to hear about?</i>

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:47.320
<i>If it's eternal happiness,
I'll forge it with my own hand</i>

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:57.290
<i>It's like we were both seeking
a coincidence that was off by a page</i>

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:59.460
<i>And that's how fate
brought us together</i>

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:07.640
<i>More than those words
that you once kept to yourself</i>

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:16.540
<i>It's the kindness that made you
keep them to yourself</i>

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:23.550
<i>That I want to have
faith in now</i>

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:31.190
<i>You know, we'll be living alongside
uncertainty from now on</i>

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:37.600
<i>We used to have nothing to lose,
but that's not us now</i>

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:45.310
<i>You know the continuation of the fairy tale
I didn't know about before?</i>

00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:51.550
<i>If it's eternal happiness,
I'll forge it with my own hand</i>

00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:55.380
<i>It's something to build up
bit by bit</i>

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:06.660
<i>"Girl In Blue"</i>

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:10.300
Next up is news concerning
the abuse of inferin.

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:15.030
<i>Concerned about its harmful effects
on the younger generation,</i>

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:18.700
<i>the authorities have worked out a policy
to crack down on it even more,</i>

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:20.940
<i>but identifying the distribution
routes has proved difficult</i>

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:23.840
<i>and at present, it appears
no concrete plans have been laid.</i>

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:35.550
<i>Why are you here?</i>

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:39.760
<i>Good morning.
Is that breakfast?</i>

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:41.430
<i>You broke it, didn't you?</i>

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:42.960
<i>What? Oh, no...</i>

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:44.490
<i>It was open.</i>

00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:48.200
<i>Go back to Miranda's place.</i>

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:51.100
<i>You are a bad cook, Mr. Roy.</i>

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:54.270
<i>Even though, Ms. Miranda
is a good cook.</i>

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:55.410
<i>Go home.</i>

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:59.110
<i>I am learning how to cook
from Ms. Miranda, you know.</i>

00:02:59.110 --> 00:02:59.980
<i>Go home!</i>

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:02.240
<i>Oh, I know! Let me
join you next time and...</i>

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:15.190
<i>Are you going out somewhere?</i>

00:03:15.190 --> 00:03:16.430
<i>I've got work.</i>

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:19.000
<i>Work?</i>

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.700
<i>I will help you.</i>

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:22.770
<i>You are not following me.</i>

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:24.400
<i>Please allow me to help you.</i>

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:25.890
<i>Don't follow me.</i>

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.240
Oh, my...

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:31.080
<i>What happened to the door?</i>

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:34.710
<i>Oh, Solty, so this
is where you were.</i>

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:36.310
<i>This is where I was.</i>

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:38.380
<i>- Hurry up and take her...
- Here you are.</i>

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:42.520
<i>A letter addressed to Solty.</i>

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:45.520
<i>It's from the city's
Civil Affairs Division.</i>

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:49.090
<i>Um..."Dear Ms. Solty Revant,</i>

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:52.200
<i>You have been
provisionally registered</i>

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:54.530
<i>as Mr. Roy Revant's
stepdaughter.</i>

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:56.900
<i>That being the case,
in order to become fully registered,</i>

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:59.940
<i>please obtain
a certificate of health</i>

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:02.870
<i>and bring it with you
to your local Center."</i>

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:09.750
<i>What kind of prank is this?!</i>

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:12.780
<i>The deal was that you
would be taking her in!</i>

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:15.620
<i>I didn't know, either.</i>

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:19.020
<i>Maybe the men from the Protection
Agency were being thoughtful.</i>

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:24.100
<i>I know...</i>

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:26.060
<i>But it's already settled anyway...</i>

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:27.400
<i>It's still provisional.</i>

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:30.270
<i>Then do you want to have
her registration stricken?</i>

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:38.340
<i>Here. It's a new job.</i>

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:41.910
<i>The client is at the hospital
where Solty's getting her physical,</i>

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:44.210
<i>- so take care of both at the same time.
- What?</i>

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:51.950
Damn...

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:54.660
<i>A hunter's been mobilized?</i>

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:58.000
<i>Yeah, it looks like some guy
accepted the job.</i>

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:00.500
<i>And what idiot would that be?</i>

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:02.030
<i>What does it matter?</i>

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:04.470
<i>The more opponents
we have to take on,</i>

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:06.440
<i>the more exciting
the game will be.</i>

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:09.340
<i>Well, whatever the case
may be, the winner...</i>

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:12.000
<i>...will be us.</i>

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:16.520
<i>An outing!
An outing!</i>

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:19.850
<i>This is our first outing
with just the two of us!</i>

00:05:19.850 --> 00:05:22.890
<i>Where is this "hospital" place?</i>

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:23.990
Is it far?

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:25.590
<i>What kinds of things
do you do there?</i>

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:27.490
<i>Are physicals fun?</i>

00:05:27.490 --> 00:05:31.860
<i>There are so many firsts for me!
I feel rather excited and nervous.</i>

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:35.070
<i>Wow! What incredible noise!</i>

00:05:35.070 --> 00:05:38.170
<i>Can you hear my voice?</i>

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:42.340
<i>Can! You! Hear! Me?!</i>

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:48.810
<i>Paging Mr. Crane
awaiting medication.</i>

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:51.780
<i>- Please come to Pharmacy Room 2.
- Thank you so much for coming.</i>

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:54.790
<i>- Repeating.
- The Hunters Guild told me
you would be coming.</i>

00:05:54.790 --> 00:06:00.190
<i>- I am Natalie Roman,
the hospital director's secretary.
- Paging Mr. Crane awaiting medication.</i>

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:03.030
<i>- Please come to Pharmacy Room 2.
- I'm Roy Revant.</i>

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:04.720
<i>I am Solty Revant.</i>

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:09.530
<i>Well then, I will
show you the way.</i>

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:10.970
<i>Please come with me...</i>

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:15.710
<i>Ouch!</i>

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:17.300
<i>A-Are you all right?!</i>

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:24.780
<i>This hospital boasts
the largest facility in the city</i>

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:26.620
<i>and provides comprehensive
medical care.</i>

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:31.260
<i>Naturally we cover pediatrics, internal
medicine, surgery, and cosmetic surgery.</i>

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:33.330
<i>But we also cover
sports medicine,</i>

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:35.560
<i>conduct research
and development of new drugs,</i>

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:42.530
<i>and furthermore, with continually
growing demand since Blast Fall,</i>

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:44.600
<i>we work with all aspects
of resemble technology,</i>

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:50.540
<i>which includes research,
development, and treatment.</i>

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:51.880
<i>Well then, Solty,</i>

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:56.150
<i>this clinician will show you
the way to your physical.</i>

00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:59.150
<i>I'm actually a resemble
engineer, you know.</i>

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:00.850
<i>Why do I have to do physicals?</i>

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:01.950
What was that?

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:03.660
<i>It's nothing.</i>

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:06.260
<i>Then, Roy, please come
to the director's office.</i>

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:09.230
<i>Wrong direction.
The director's office is this way.</i>

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:13.560
<i>Yes, of course.
This way.</i>

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:16.970
<i>Come on,
you're coming this way.</i>

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:18.840
<i>Don't give me any trouble, okay?</i>

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:20.240
<i>Y-Yes, Sir.</i>

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:28.950
<i>Well, thank you for coming.</i>

00:07:28.950 --> 00:07:34.190
<i>I'm the director of this hospital.
Dewey Black.</i>

00:07:34.190 --> 00:07:37.190
<i>Let's hear the details of the job.</i>

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:39.490
<i>Just what I'd expect from
a professional hunter- for- hire.</i>

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:42.030
<i>You're most intent
on your work.</i>

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:43.720
<i>Please come with me.</i>

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:55.010
<i>I'd like for you to protect
that case from thieves.</i>

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:56.240
<i>Thieves?</i>

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.840
<i>Yes, I received a warning note.</i>

00:07:58.840 --> 00:08:01.980
<i>All it said was,
"We're coming for it."</i>

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:04.020
<i>Where's this note?</i>

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:07.650
<i>I'm sorry.
I lost it.</i>

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:09.420
<i>What's in the case?</i>

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:11.820
<i>There's no need
for you to know that.</i>

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:15.020
<i>All I need is for you
to protect that case.</i>

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:22.270
<i>The anti-theft system
is foolproof.</i>

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:25.440
<i>And only I know the code
to undo the lock.</i>

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:29.770
<i>I have to transport this case
tomorrow to a certain location.</i>

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:35.550
<i>I would like for your duties to also include
escort service during that time.</i>

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:36.570
All right.

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:42.520
<i>Excuse me...</i>

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:46.860
<i>What kinds of things are we doing
during this "physical examination"?</i>

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:51.030
<i>I'm just going to check you
on that scan bed.</i>

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:54.070
<i>Hurry up and lie down
on the bed. I'm busy.</i>

00:08:54.070 --> 00:08:55.500
<i>Y-Yes, Sir!</i>

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:03.840
<i>I wonder if Roy has
finished his work already.</i>

00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:06.210
<i>I wanted to help him...</i>

00:09:39.610 --> 00:09:43.410
<i>Do doctors these days
also do electrical work?</i>

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:50.190
A kid?

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:51.390
<i>I'm not a kid!</i>

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:53.890
<i>You are a kid!</i>

00:09:53.890 --> 00:09:55.390
<i>Allow me to introduce you.</i>

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:58.600
<i>This is my younger brother,
Andy Anderson.</i>

00:09:58.600 --> 00:10:00.370
And I'm...

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:02.500
<i>...Larry Anderson.</i>

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:06.400
<i>Pleased to make your
acquaintance, Mr. Roy Revant.</i>

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:08.370
<i>Larry Anderson?</i>

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:10.910
<i>The Anderson brother thieves?</i>

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:13.450
<i>Considering how you went to the trouble
of sending a warning note,</i>

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:16.080
<i>you're apparently the pretentious
bastard that everyone says you are.</i>

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:18.280
<i>I've heard about you, too.</i>

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:20.590
<i>You're looking
for your missing child</i>

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:24.620
<i>and I hear you were quite the hell raiser
underground back in the day.</i>

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:25.990
Ah-ah.

00:10:25.990 --> 00:10:28.930
<i>I'd rather not work
any harder than I have to.</i>

00:10:28.930 --> 00:10:31.120
<i>I'll kindly ask
that you behave yourself.</i>

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:48.450
<i>What are you trying to do?</i>

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:51.080
<i>That is none of your business.</i>

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:53.050
<i>Keep your mouth shut and watch.</i>

00:10:59.490 --> 00:11:01.030
<i>No particular abnormalities.</i>

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:02.660
<i>Nothing abnormal here, either.</i>

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:06.000
<i>As for the scanned data...</i>

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:08.870
Wh-What?!

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:11.340
<i>This can't... possibly...</i>

00:11:11.340 --> 00:11:14.770
<i>No, there's no doubt about it.</i>

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:17.880
<i>I've never seen
anything like it.</i>

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:20.610
<i>The diagnostic machine
needs more power.</i>

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:24.480
<i>I want to try it...</i>

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:26.280
<i>...to see the response!</i>

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:31.190
<i>Hey! Are you planning on
cutting the power to this place?!</i>

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:36.730
<i>You do that and people undergoing surgery
and on life support will die!</i>

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:38.900
<i>Shut up, Mister!</i>

00:11:38.900 --> 00:11:42.570
<i>We know this facility
has its own power generator.</i>

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:44.570
<i>We only need it to go down
for a mere moment.</i>

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:46.640
<i>Then our job will be done.</i>

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:49.070
<i>And the patients
won't suffer any ill effects.</i>

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:50.630
<i>It's a simple game.</i>

00:11:52.740 --> 00:11:55.510
<i>Excuse me,
what are these...</i>

00:11:55.510 --> 00:11:57.920
<i>You have nothing
to worry about.</i>

00:11:57.920 --> 00:12:01.190
<i>It's a machine to examine you
more closely. Okay?</i>

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:02.210
All right.

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:05.820
<i>Here we go...
Here we go...</i>

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:16.270
<i>What the- ?</i>

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:19.360
Oh?

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:22.740
Andy!

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:24.440
<i>I-It wasn't me!</i>

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:28.600
<i>Bro!</i>

00:12:42.230 --> 00:12:43.590
Damn it.

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:47.830
<i>What is the meaning of this?!</i>

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:50.570
<i>The thieves were right there
and you let them escape?!</i>

00:12:50.570 --> 00:12:53.770
<i>Please wait a minute. Roy was trying
to stop the thieves and...</i>

00:12:53.770 --> 00:12:55.140
<i>Quiet!</i>

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:59.080
<i>I swear! I never expected
that you would be so ineffectual!</i>

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:03.410
<i>I will be increasing the number of hunters
on tomorrow's escort detail.</i>

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:09.750
<i>That expense will be coming out
of your reward. Is that understood?</i>

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:11.090
<i>Do what you want.</i>

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:17.830
<i>You know...</i>

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:22.130
<i>I know you've wanted to join
the resemble research lab for a long time,</i>

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:25.840
<i>but that doesn't mean you have to go
and wreck the diagnostics system</i>

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:30.110
<i>by directly connecting it
to the main power line.</i>

00:13:30.110 --> 00:13:31.610
Amazing...

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:34.880
<i>Amazing!
She's really amazing!</i>

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:37.720
<i>If I could just
examine her more...</i>

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:40.850
Amazing... It's amazing!

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:42.440
<i>You're fired.</i>

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:51.100
Uh, um...

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:52.430
<i>Go to sleep.</i>

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:53.620
Okay.

00:14:03.680 --> 00:14:05.640
<i>Good night.</i>

00:14:15.490 --> 00:14:17.460
<i>There are so many people.</i>

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:18.960
<i>Don't mind them.</i>

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:22.390
<i>We'll just do the job
we're supposed to do.</i>

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:23.360
Right!

00:14:26.960 --> 00:14:29.260
<i>Well then, let us depart.</i>

00:14:40.110 --> 00:14:41.650
<i>With this array of escorts,</i>

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:43.670
<i>I doubt the thieves
will be able to do anything.</i>

00:14:53.730 --> 00:14:56.960
<i>Excuse me, but is it all right
for us to lag so far behind?</i>

00:14:59.430 --> 00:15:01.630
<i>They're not showing up.</i>

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:04.070
<i>Looks like we'll have
an easy time on the job today.</i>

00:15:07.440 --> 00:15:08.670
<i>Sorry for the wait.</i>

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:10.480
<i>It's time to start the game.</i>

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:11.570
<i>There they are!</i>

00:15:17.380 --> 00:15:18.910
What's this stuff?

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:26.750
<i>- Oh, no!
- Hang on!</i>

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:33.030
<i>Wh-What the?! What the hell's
going on back there?!</i>

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:36.330
<i>What else?</i>

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:38.070
<i>They got taken out by my bro.</i>

00:15:38.070 --> 00:15:39.060
Bastard!

00:15:48.810 --> 00:15:50.920
<i>Hey, hey, what do you think that is?</i>

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:54.220
<i>- What? What?
- The teacher's going to be here soon.</i>

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:56.350
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:58.850
<i>Whoa, they're really going at it.</i>

00:16:03.260 --> 00:16:06.400
<i>Bro, he's still not showing
any signs of stopping.</i>

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:08.600
<i>He must be loyal to his job.</i>

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:11.430
<i>Then shall we do this
the way thieves do it?!</i>

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:22.710
<i>This is definitely more my style.</i>

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.940
<i>All right then,
I guess I'll take...</i>

00:16:27.350 --> 00:16:28.480
What?!

00:16:30.560 --> 00:16:31.890
<i>It's payback for yesterday.</i>

00:16:31.890 --> 00:16:34.060
<i>I will help, too.</i>

00:16:34.060 --> 00:16:35.360
<i>Hey! Wait!</i>

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:44.160
<i>Oh, hey! You're not
grabbing that from me!</i>

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:50.680
<i>Oh, my, it seems they've gotten
quite a ways ahead of us.</i>

00:16:50.680 --> 00:16:52.680
<i>Don't give me that "they've
gotten ahead of us" crap!</i>

00:16:52.680 --> 00:16:55.010
<i>We have to hurry
and chase after them as well!</i>

00:16:55.010 --> 00:16:58.720
<i>I'm getting tired
of this look.</i>

00:16:58.720 --> 00:17:00.150
<i>Tired of it?</i>

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:06.420
<i>The real one's been at home
on vacation since yesterday.</i>

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:13.050
<i>See ya!</i>

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:16.500
<i>Damn it! Damn it!
You squirrelly little...</i>

00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:30.550
<i>I protected it, Mr. Roy!</i>

00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:31.810
That girl...

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:40.730
<i>People say this is a sad era.</i>

00:17:40.730 --> 00:17:43.530
<i>People say this is a foolish era.</i>

00:17:43.530 --> 00:17:45.260
<i>- Hey!
- But!</i>

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:51.440
<i>- Just now, a single meteor has shot down
to shine hope upon that dark world!
- What's up with that act?</i>

00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:52.770
<i>Her name is...</i>

00:17:57.310 --> 00:18:00.640
<i>...Rose, the Blue Meteor!
And she has arrived!</i>

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:04.680
<i>I wonder what kind of fools
her parents are.</i>

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:07.550
<i>Rose, you're supposed
to be guarding the rear!</i>

00:18:07.550 --> 00:18:09.620
<i>The best defense is offense.</i>

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:12.090
<i>That's a way too
convenient interpretation!</i>

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:13.960
Shut up!

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:16.930
<i>Let's get out of here.
We got what we came for.</i>

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:18.290
<i>Please wait.</i>

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:23.900
<i>Please return that case.</i>

00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:33.310
<i>H-Hey! If you do that,
the contents of the case will...</i>

00:18:33.310 --> 00:18:36.150
<i>Shut up! I'm going to
blow them all up together!</i>

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:37.010
<i>Stop it!</i>

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:45.160
<i>Hey!</i>

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:46.120
<i>Mr. Roy!</i>

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:47.250
<i>W-Wait!
You...</i>

00:18:58.570 --> 00:18:59.600
<i>Are you okay?</i>

00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:01.070
<i>Yes.</i>

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:04.210
<i>Thank goodness
you are okay, Mr. Roy.</i>

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:05.610
<i>You...</i>

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:06.870
<i>Roy Revant.</i>

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:11.070
<i>The case!</i>

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:15.420
<i>Rose!</i>

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:16.620
Okay!

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:17.850
<i>Cannon mode!</i>

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:22.390
<i>Go!</i>

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:34.670
This is...

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:37.070
<i>That's right.
It's inferin.</i>

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:39.440
<i>That's what we'd planned
to do with it all along.</i>

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:43.780
<i>That old bastard was even
trying to sell that to kids!</i>

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:44.680
<i>More importantly,</i>

00:19:44.680 --> 00:19:48.450
<i>- what about what you did
to the arm on my machine, Mister?!
- Robin Hoods, huh? Pretentious bastards.</i>

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:49.790
<i>Hey, listen when I'm talking!</i>

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:51.390
<i>Let's go.</i>

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:52.450
Damn.

00:19:54.530 --> 00:19:56.290
<i>Solty.</i>

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:58.200
<i>I enjoyed our game.</i>

00:19:58.200 --> 00:20:00.870
<i>You're pretty good.</i>

00:20:00.870 --> 00:20:02.420
<i>Let's meet again!</i>

00:20:05.840 --> 00:20:08.510
Okay!

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:10.610
My...

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:12.840
<i>My case...</i>

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:15.350
<i>To think you were selling
inferin on the black market...</i>

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:18.180
<i>I-I know nothing. I...</i>

00:20:18.180 --> 00:20:20.120
<i>Violation of the Pharmaceutical
Business Law.</i>

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:24.020
<i>Things have gotten way out of hand
for you to try to cover it up now.</i>

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:26.250
<i>You're finished.</i>

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:35.370
<i>So, the client got arrested
and the reward went out the window?</i>

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:37.440
<i>Talk about profiting
in nothing but exhaustion.</i>

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:40.070
<i>Is exhaustion profitable?</i>

00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:42.870
<i>Beats me.</i>

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:45.740
<i>That's your ID card.</i>

00:20:45.740 --> 00:20:47.710
<i>I got it from the Center.</i>

00:20:47.710 --> 00:20:48.950
<i>Oh, okay.</i>

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:50.820
<i>What's this change of heart?</i>

00:20:50.820 --> 00:20:52.120
<i>I just happened to be there.</i>

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:55.550
<i>Oh, good.
You're all here.</i>

00:20:55.550 --> 00:20:59.220
<i>I have someone to introduce to you.
He's moving in next door, starting today.</i>

00:20:59.220 --> 00:21:01.390
<i>This is Yuto K. Steel.</i>

00:21:01.390 --> 00:21:05.830
<i>I've hired him on as a mechanic.
I hope you'll all be nice to him.</i>

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:07.800
Uh... What?

00:21:07.800 --> 00:21:11.770
<i>Oh, this feel,
this elasticity...</i>

00:21:11.770 --> 00:21:16.440
<i>Say, won't you let me
examine all that is you?</i>

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:20.580
<i>Naturally, I'll show you
my appreciation in kind.</i>

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:22.350
<i>You didn't have to be that rough.</i>

00:21:22.350 --> 00:21:24.920
<i>He's a pervert!
Turn him over to the police!</i>

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:26.850
<i>What did you do that for
all of a sudden?!</i>

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:28.220
<i>I'm a resemble engineer and...</i>

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:30.590
<i>- You're a pervert!
- Miranda!</i>

00:21:30.590 --> 00:21:32.260
<i>I wonder what kind of fools
your parents are!</i>

00:21:32.260 --> 00:21:33.690
<i>- Solty... Revant...
- I'm sure I'm better off than you are.</i>

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:35.460
<i>- Solty... Revant...
- Shut up!</i>

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:37.560
<i>Don't give me that crap!</i>

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:38.900
<i>I'm sorry! I'm sorry!</i>

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:40.630
<i>You perverted bastard!</i>

00:21:53.480 --> 00:21:58.250
<i>On a clear day in the park</i>

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:01.180
<i>Looking up at the sky</i>

00:22:01.180 --> 00:22:12.430
<i>There was a tiny little cloud
that almost vanished</i>

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:17.200
<i>Letting the wind
take us where it will</i>

00:22:17.200 --> 00:22:20.140
<i>We live freely</i>

00:22:20.140 --> 00:22:28.180
<i>We make our way,
walking a little at a time</i>

00:22:28.180 --> 00:22:32.950
<i>We're the same</i>

00:22:32.950 --> 00:22:37.720
<i>This precious time</i>

00:22:37.720 --> 00:22:41.560
<i>Each time we meet</i>

00:22:41.560 --> 00:22:51.100
<i>This feeling of not being alone
turns into kindness</i>

00:22:51.100 --> 00:22:57.440
<i>I can turn it into the courage
to believe in someone</i>

00:22:57.440 --> 00:23:09.870
<i>And surely, before I vanish
into the far reaches of that sky...</i>

00:23:16.560 --> 00:23:19.490
<i>My precious little girl.</i>

00:23:19.490 --> 00:23:21.660
<i>My first...</i>

00:23:21.660 --> 00:23:23.700
<i>Next time, "friend".</i>

00:23:23.700 --> 00:23:26.760
<i>Have you met yours?</i>
